WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:02.092
SHE-HULK
Alright, let's do this.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.558
TATIANA MASLANY
What's so fun about She-Hulk

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:07.803
is that there are a
lot of unexpected cameos.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.412
Hulk.

00:00:08.462 --> 00:00:08.888
HOLDEN HOLLIWAY
Blonksy.

00:00:08.938 --> 00:00:09.467
SHE-HULK
Wong.

00:00:09.517 --> 00:00:10.056
BRIDESMAID
Titania.

00:00:13.532 --> 00:00:15.171
SHE-HULK
I will kill for you, Megan Thee Stallion.

00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:16.601
MEGAN THEE STALLION
Oh, you are way more fun

00:00:16.651 --> 00:00:17.683
than my last lawyer!

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:19.483
GINGER GONZAGA
Megan's a really good actor.

00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:21.313
TATIANA MASLANY
I'm a huge fan. Like it was crazy.

00:00:21.839 --> 00:00:23.361
KAT COIRO
You think of this huge star,

00:00:23.411 --> 00:00:25.317
but Megan was just awesome.

00:00:25.982 --> 00:00:27.567
MEGAN THEE STALLION
I am doing groundbreaking things.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.064
Twerking in Marvel.

00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:32.217
And I like to think of myself
as a version of Thanos.

00:00:32.702 --> 00:00:34.367
THANOS
I don't even know who you are.

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:35.208
[Laughing]

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.385
JENNIFER WALTERS
Just remember whose show this actually is.

00:00:38.742 --> 00:00:40.207
KAT COIRO
Every episode introduces a

00:00:40.257 --> 00:00:44.689
crazy cast of people. There's so much
more to come in this wacky world.

00:00:46.036 --> 00:00:46.747
HULK
Boom!

00:00:46.798 --> 00:00:47.333
MEGAN THEE STALLION
Eh.

00:00:51.278 --> 00:00:52.000
Eh.

